Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.57,0:00:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as there are people\Nwho seek freedom in this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.03,0:00:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these things shall not\Nvanish from the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.73,0:00:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People tell me my head's in the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.61,0:00:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what they say\Nbecause I'm dreaming of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.97,0:00:43.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the treasure I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.67,0:00:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So bright, so bold, it's so elusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.75,0:00:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.83,0:00:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it's blinding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.95,0:00:55.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no words to\Ndescribe how I feel inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.77,0:00:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really, really stuck on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.23,0:01:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.63,0:01:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I won't stop till I\Nget there, you will see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.67,0:01:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I need to have\Nthe strength to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.99,0:01:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe in wonderland.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.89,0:01:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.21,0:01:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna share them\Nwith you, a love so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.25,0:01:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I want.\NTogether we can move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.65,0:01:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live how we want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no limit to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.65,0:01:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want to live ordinary lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.71,0:01:39.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a chance to live in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.77,0:01:42.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live in one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.03,0:01:54.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tsunami!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.93,0:01:57.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.37,0:01:59.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.31,0:02:02.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe it wasn't really such a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.73,0:02:04.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What wasn't a good idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.17,0:02:06.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I warned him, but he didn't listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.11,0:02:08.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said he was so thirsty he\Ncouldn't stand it anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.71,0:02:11.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so he chomped down on some of\Nthat cactus growing back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.09,0:02:13.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to suck out the moisture. Cactus?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.69,0:02:15.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.03,0:02:17.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those round things.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.25,0:02:19.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A tsunami! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.33,0:02:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.93,0:02:22.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those are mezcal cacti!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.79,0:02:24.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're used to make hallucinogenic drugs!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.07,0:02:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.87,0:02:27.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.41,0:02:29.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna drown!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.45,0:02:33.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, bring it on if you got the gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.37,0:02:34.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll beat you all up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.77,0:02:39.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.65,0:02:41.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.21,0:02:46.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.57,0:02:47.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Chopper.
