Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.15,0:02:52.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The operation will begin at the\Nstroke of noon two days from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.27,0:02:55.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you completed the arrangements?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.93,0:02:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, everything's in place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.85,0:03:01.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have 150 billions who\Nare standing by in Nanohana.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.55,0:03:04.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've also called Mr. Two back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.25,0:03:09.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It appears that he failed utterly in\Nhis assignment to capture and kill Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.15,0:03:09.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.35,0:03:14.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The officer agents have been instructed\Nto gather tonight at 8 o 'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.13,0:03:17.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're meeting at the Spider's Cafe.
