Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.59,0:03:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.93,0:03:24.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's already past 5 o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.41,0:03:27.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would imagine that\Nthe officer agents will
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.31,0:03:29.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,begin gathering at the\Ncafe any minute now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.67,0:03:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well, Merry\NChristmas, Merry Christmas!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.55,0:03:51.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was an exhausting trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.77,0:03:53.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My back is really killing me here.
