Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.91,0:03:55.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is your fault, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.33,0:03:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.24,0:03:57.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.16,0:04:00.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we'd gotten here quicker, my\Nback wouldn't hurt right now.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:58.40,0:04:03.37,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an5\q2\pos(720,420)\blur1.2\bord5.6\fscx83\fscy95\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp8\c&H121212&\3c&H121212&}Mr. 4\NOfficer Agent, Baroque Works
Dialogue: 2,0:03:58.40,0:04:03.37,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an5\q2\pos(720,420)\blur1.2\bord0.6\fscx83\fscy95\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp8\3c&HFFFFFF&\4a&HFF&}Mr. 4\NOfficer Agent, Baroque Works
Dialogue: 3,0:03:58.40,0:04:03.37,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an5\q2\pos(720,420)\blur1.3\bord0\fscx83\fscy95\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp8\4a&HFF&}Mr. 4\NOfficer Agent, Baroque Works
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.59,0:04:03.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.75,0:04:04.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.19,0:04:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's business?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.10,0:04:07.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He says, Paula, your\Nplace sure is empty today.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.65,0:04:08.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an empty place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.61,0:04:10.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Place, empty, place, empty, empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.19,0:04:14.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it is certainly good to see\Nyou again, Miss Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.65,0:04:15.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.07,0:04:19.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four, you will have the shop\Nall to yourselves for a while.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:16.34,0:04:26.10,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an5\q2\blur1.2\bord5.6\fscx83\fscy95\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp8\c&H121212&\3c&H121212&\pos(720,470.67)}Paula, Proprietor, Spiders Cafe
Dialogue: 2,0:04:16.34,0:04:26.10,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an5\q2\blur1.2\bord0.6\fscx83\fscy95\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp8\3c&HFFFFFF&\4a&HFF&\pos(720,470.67)}Paula, Proprietor, Spiders Cafe
Dialogue: 3,0:04:16.34,0:04:26.10,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an5\q2\blur1.3\bord0\fscx83\fscy95\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp8\4a&HFF&\pos(720,470.67)}Paula, Proprietor, Spiders Cafe
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.57,0:04:21.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can go ahead and brew\Nsome tea for you if you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.77,0:04:23.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,don't mind waiting a few\Nminutes for it to steep
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.83,0:04:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it chamomile as usual,\NMr. Four? No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.01,0:04:28.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,want to wait for tea i\Nwant something i can drink
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.57,0:04:30.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right now something fast\Nright away right away
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.63,0:04:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no waiting right now okay\Ngot it you seem to be in
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.61,0:04:35.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,good spirits is work going\Nwell for you right now
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.99,0:04:37.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in my line of work if\Nyou don't do well you die
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.07,0:04:39.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so obviously it's going\Nwell you stupid woman
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.01,0:04:44.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stupid woman stuman stuman\Nof course i'll forget
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.41,0:04:51.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Full of me, I'm sorry.\NWhat is that noise? What
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.41,0:04:53.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kind of crazy singers are\Nyou using in this place
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.53,0:04:57.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These days, idiot singers?\NNo, I have a classical
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.37,0:05:00.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sonata playing right now\Nthere are no words there
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.13,0:05:01.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shouldn't be any singing
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.17,0:05:05.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,strange
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.25,0:05:08.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the clouds and
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.73,0:05:13.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,feet on the ground and fly\Nlike a fish in a stream
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.31,0:05:23.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and spin, just remember, spin, spin,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.71,0:05:29.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pretty shoes, and mascara,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.29,0:05:31.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,pretty shoes and mascara.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.69,0:05:37.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm such a lovely dancing boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.81,0:05:42.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, we say,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.43,0:05:43.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,switch foot,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.11,0:05:50.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,switch foot, and up, and up,\Nand now, leap away, let's hear
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.69,0:05:54.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your boys sing it, mascara, and shoes,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.41,0:05:59.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hand up, tutu, Ogan's away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.07,0:06:08.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello to all and how I do today?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.41,0:06:11.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a freak!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.33,0:06:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not a freak, Paula.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.11,0:06:16.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am merely a talented\Ndancer practicing my craft.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.03,0:06:19.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will take one sparkling water, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.11,0:06:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't have any.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.02,0:06:21.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't have any?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.33,0:06:25.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me a break That's what all\Nthe high-class ballerinas drink
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.19,0:06:29.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're still here You\Nguys can leave now Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.89,0:06:33.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't forget to practice those\Nnew dance moves like we talked about!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.67,0:06:34.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.58,0:06:37.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unit! Unit! How nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.51,0:06:39.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fatty and the old\Nhag are here with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.65,0:06:41.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you just shake your fat mouth,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.41,0:06:44.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you weirdo ballet-dancing\Nswadwearing freak of nature!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.17,0:06:47.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, nice to see you! Did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.29,0:06:48.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems like even Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.59,0:06:50.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One's team is being mobilized\Nfor this assignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.89,0:06:54.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never actually had the pleasure\Nof meeting him and his partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.79,0:06:56.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really very excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.73,0:07:05.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a little something\NI wanted you to have. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.05,0:07:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do yourself a favor and hang on to that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.81,0:07:13.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's just a scrap of paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.15,0:07:16.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That paper will reunite us someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.49,0:07:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd tuck it away\Nsomewhere for safekeeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.59,0:07:21.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't want it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.33,0:07:23.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.97,0:07:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's perfectly natural for a guy to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.59,0:07:29.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,About his bungling kid brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.43,0:07:33.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He might be a bit much\Nfor all of you to handle!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.79,0:07:35.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But take good care of him for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.63,0:07:39.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're leaving already?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.85,0:07:47.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, when next we meet\Nwe'll both be top pirates
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.39,0:08:14.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy, what was that\Nthing your brother gave you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.39,0:08:15.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't really know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.03,0:08:18.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just looks like a scrap of paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.43,0:08:19.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just paper?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.75,0:08:20.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.05,0:08:25.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it looks like it really\Nis just a piece of paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.13,0:08:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's nothing written on it or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.41,0:08:30.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that all really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.49,0:08:35.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not really sure why Ace gave\Nit to me, but it's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.31,0:08:39.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't eat that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.75,0:08:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't, camel!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.87,0:08:43.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy, give me your hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.87,0:08:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.78,0:08:46.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it's really that important to you,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.53,0:08:48.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can sew it to the\Nunderside of your hat ribbon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.51,0:08:49.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.42,0:08:50.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sew it on real good!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.57,0:08:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.21,0:08:54.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, it's all done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.49,0:08:57.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.55,0:08:59.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I don't have to worry about losing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.63,0:09:00.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.54,0:09:04.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there isn't anything written on it,\Nwhat's the point of hanging on to the thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.29,0:09:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ace said it's important and I should\Nhang on to it, so I'm hanging on to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.63,0:09:08.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.54,0:09:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're pretty much just\Nbasing your decision on nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.59,0:09:13.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, my instincts, they're right a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.99,0:09:15.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As sharp as a tooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.33,0:09:17.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will someone please carry me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.99,0:09:24.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moment by moment, the\Nnight grows later. We
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.49,0:09:27.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are nearing eight o\N'clock the appointed time
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.69,0:09:38.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,oh i'm so bored
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.53,0:09:42.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time to practice my spinning
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.01,0:09:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, what's your problem, you old hag?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.29,0:09:52.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.25,0:09:54.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you really think you could handle me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.39,0:09:56.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come now, why don't you two cut it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.55,0:09:57.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.41,0:10:10.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.63,0:10:12.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why are you lying there\Non the ground instead
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.45,0:10:14.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of practicing like you're\Nsupposed to be doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.31,0:10:15.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We weren't, Talium!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.21,0:10:20.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, so these men are\Nacquaintances of yours.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:22.54,0:10:35.51,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an5\q2\pos(720,393.67)\blur1.2\bord4.5\fscx98\fscy110\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp8\c&H121212&\3c&H121212&}Mr. 1\N{\bord5.4\fscx83\fscy95}Officer Agent, Baroque Works
Dialogue: 2,0:10:22.54,0:10:35.51,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an5\q2\pos(720,393.67)\blur1.2\bord0.6\fscx98\fscy110\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp8\3c&HFFFFFF&\4a&HFF&}Mr. 1\N{\fscx83\fscy95}Officer Agent, Baroque Works
Dialogue: 3,0:10:22.54,0:10:35.51,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an5\q2\pos(720,393.67)\blur1.3\bord0\fscx98\fscy110\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp8\4a&HFF&}Mr. 1\N{\fscx83\fscy95}Officer Agent, Baroque Works
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.81,0:10:26.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, I found them acting\Nsuspicious out in the desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.01,0:10:28.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I doubt they'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.49,0:10:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You seem unnecessarily\Nconcerned about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.35,0:10:35.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fostering friendships\Nwill only make you weaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.83,0:10:38.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those men of mine, they\Ndon't belong to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.31,0:10:39.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better stop, Mr. Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.35,0:10:43.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.09,0:10:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.99,0:10:51.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.11,0:10:53.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.21,0:11:00.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.91,0:11:05.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.71,0:11:07.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He flew straight to the wall!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.85,0:11:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He barely seemed to\Nnotice it was happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.29,0:11:14.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you want to die that badly?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.53,0:11:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.45,0:11:18.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough playing around, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.15,0:11:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.09,0:11:19.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.29,0:11:21.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move, Miss Doublefinger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.51,0:11:23.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still haven't killed him yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.13,0:11:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.04,0:11:25.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.96,0:11:26.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just get off me, fatty!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.87,0:11:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're killing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.78,0:11:28.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.70,0:11:30.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two, it's time for you\Nto calm down as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.59,0:11:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's eight o 'clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.61,0:11:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the agents that\Nshould be here are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.11,0:11:40.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's more, a letter containing the\Norders has arrived at the Spider's Cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.63,0:11:46.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, we're instructed to head to\NRainbase, the city of dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.13,0:11:49.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that city we'll meet someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.35,0:11:52.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A man we know, but whose\Nface we have never seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.55,0:11:59.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're heading to meet the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.87,0:12:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The officer agent should all be on\Ntheir way here to Rain Base as we speak.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:11.48,0:12:16.57,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(720,503)\fad(480,440)\blur0.6\bord4.5\fscx64\fscy85\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(0,480,\1a&H00&)\t(4650,5090,\1a&HFF&)}Bunchi\NSpecial All-Terrain Transport Turtle\NBaroque Works
Dialogue: 2,0:12:11.48,0:12:16.57,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(720,503)\fad(480,440)\blur0.5\bord0.6\fscx64\fscy85\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\c&HFEFEFF&\3c&HFEFEFF&\1a&HFF&\4a&HFF&\t(0,480,\1a&H00&)\t(4650,5090,\1a&HFF&)}Bunchi\NSpecial All-Terrain Transport Turtle\NBaroque Works
Dialogue: 3,0:12:11.48,0:12:16.57,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(720,503)\fad(480,440)\blur0.5\bord0\fscx64\fscy85\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\c&HFEFEFF&\4a&HFF&}Bunchi\NSpecial All-Terrain Transport Turtle\NBaroque Works
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.85,0:12:15.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sent bunchy to get them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.63,0:12:18.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I expect them to arrive\Nsometime later tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.83,0:12:25.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To think that you've\Nactually been Miss Double
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.27,0:12:28.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finger this entire time\Nthat's very interesting.
Dialogue: 3,0:12:28.37,0:12:34.25,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(720,479.2)\blur1\bord5.5\fscx77\fscy88\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp7\c&H131313&\3c&H171717&}Miss Doublefinger\NOfficer Agent, Baroque Works
Dialogue: 3,0:12:28.37,0:12:34.25,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(720,479.2)\blur0.9\bord0.6\fscx77\fscy88\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp7\c&HFEFEFF&\3c&HFEFEFF&\4a&HFF&}Miss Doublefinger\NOfficer Agent, Baroque Works
Dialogue: 3,0:12:28.37,0:12:34.25,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(720,479.2)\blur1.5\bord0\fscx77\fscy88\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp7\c&HFEFEFF&\4a&HFF&}Miss Doublefinger\NOfficer Agent, Baroque Works
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.95,0:12:34.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who knows, perhaps I would have told you,\Nbut none of you ever asked me about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.67,0:12:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The billions that we lost in Nanohana,\Nhave you been able to find replacements?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.95,0:12:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've made the assignments\Nfor the replacements.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.07,0:12:45.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As far as contacting the new billions,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.81,0:12:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've dispatched the lizard\Nrunners to see to that.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:48.98,0:12:51.27,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(728.01,516)\fad(475,0)\blur0.4\bord4.5\fscx67\fscy79\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp7\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(0,475,\1a&H00&)}Frilled Runners\NUrgent Delivery Force\NBaroque Works
Dialogue: 2,0:12:48.98,0:12:51.27,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(728.01,516)\fad(475,0)\blur0.4\bord0.6\fscx67\fscy79\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp7\c&HFEFEFF&\3c&HFEFEFF&\1a&HFF&\4a&HFF&\t(0,475,\1a&H00&)}{Lizard Runners}Frilled Runners\NUrgent Delivery Force\NBaroque Works
Dialogue: 3,0:12:48.98,0:12:51.27,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(728.01,516)\fad(475,0)\blur0.4\bord0\fscx67\fscy79\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\fsp7\c&HFEFEFF&\4a&HFF&}{Lizard Runners}Frilled Runners\NUrgent Delivery Force\NBaroque Works
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.19,0:12:57.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.23,0:12:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things are almost ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.23,0:13:07.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look up ahead! I see a\Nlight! Does that mean we?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.33,0:13:10.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,made it to Yuba I can't\Nsee with all this sand
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.35,0:13:13.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,blowing everywhere\Nsomething here doesn't feel
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.49,0:13:17.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right there's something\Nwrong down there I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.29,0:13:26.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.69,0:13:33.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The entire city is being\Nstruck by a sandstorm!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.03,0:13:46.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't be.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:47.99,0:13:56.67,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(707.98,496)\fad(483,0)\blur0.5\bord4.8\fscx88\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(0,483,\1a&H00&)}Yuba Oasis\NArabasta Kingdom
Dialogue: 2,0:13:47.99,0:13:56.67,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(707.98,496)\fad(483,0)\blur0.5\bord0.6\fscx88\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\c&HFEFEFF&\3c&HFEFEFF&\1a&HFF&\4a&HFF&\t(0,483,\1a&H00&)}Yuba Oasis\NArabasta Kingdom
Dialogue: 3,0:13:47.99,0:13:56.67,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(707.98,496)\fad(483,0)\blur0.5\bord0\fscx88\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\c&HFEFEFF&\4a&HFF&}Yuba Oasis\NArabasta Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.71,0:13:52.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.45,0:13:56.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place doesn't look much different\Nfrom that Aramalu town from before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.99,0:13:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Water!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.67,0:14:03.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi, I thought this city was\Nsupposed to be some sort of oasis.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.99,0:14:05.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like the oasis has disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.05,0:14:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been swallowed up by all the sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.83,0:14:15.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm assuming that you're travelers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.63,0:14:20.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must be exhausted from all\Nthe time spent in that heat!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.35,0:14:24.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but this town\Nis a bit dried up too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.81,0:14:26.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't have much relief to offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.13,0:14:31.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still, you're free\Nto rest here for a while.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:33.58,0:14:41.55,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(707.98,610)\fad(483,0)\blur0.5\bord4.9\fscx88\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(0,483,\1a&H00&)}Toto\NA Man from Yuba
Dialogue: 2,0:14:33.58,0:14:41.55,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(707.98,610)\fad(483,0)\blur0.5\bord0.6\fscx88\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\c&HFEFEFF&\3c&HFEFEFF&\1a&HFF&\4a&HFF&\t(0,483,\1a&H00&)}Toto\NA Man from Yuba
Dialogue: 3,0:14:33.58,0:14:41.55,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(707.98,610)\fad(483,0)\blur0.5\bord0\fscx88\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\c&HFEFEFF&\4a&HFF&}Toto\NA Man from Yuba
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.05,0:14:35.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We may not have much water.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.79,0:14:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there are plenty of\Ninns here in the town.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.75,0:14:41.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's what we've prided\Nourselves so much on after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.11,0:14:46.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, but we came here because we\Nthought the Rebel Army was in this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.29,0:14:49.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What business do you\Nhave with the Rebel Army?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.93,0:14:50.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Curse all of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.01,0:14:55.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're here to join the Rebel Army,\Nyou can just go back where you came from!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.97,0:15:01.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're looking for those\Nfools, look elsewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.71,0:15:03.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're no longer in this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.25,0:15:05.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, they're gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.07,0:15:08.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They left!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.47,0:15:09.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.21,0:15:15.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The town was just hit by a sandstorm,\Nbut that one certainly wasn't the first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.39,0:15:20.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After three years of no rain, the\Nland has become increasingly dry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.93,0:15:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sandstorms became a\Nregular occurrence here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.69,0:15:24.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Little by little,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.81,0:15:29.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the oasis that we knew was swallowed up\Nuntil the town became what you see now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.29,0:15:31.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a dying wasteland.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.45,0:15:35.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the flow of supplies\Nto the town Ended the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.33,0:15:38.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,rebel army couldn't maintain\Ntheir Tornado struggle,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.23,0:15:39.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so they packed up
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.05,0:15:44.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They've moved. The rebel base\Nis now located in Katorea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.25,0:15:50.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, where's that is\NKatorea close to here Vivi?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.79,0:15:54.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's near Nanohana, back\Nthe way we came. Well
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.41,0:15:57.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,great coming all this way\Nwas just a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.41,0:15:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.69,0:16:01.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait your names hold on
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.59,0:16:05.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.97,0:16:09.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Princess Vivi, is that really you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.77,0:16:11.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.33,0:16:14.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it. Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.31,0:16:16.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's me, Vivi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.09,0:16:18.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you recognize me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.01,0:16:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I look different.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.21,0:16:23.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I lost some weight, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.87,0:16:26.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toto, is it really you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.81,0:16:29.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.91,0:16:36.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.71,0:16:43.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So long, my princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.43,0:16:45.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't see you for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.71,0:16:48.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As soon as Yuba's up and\Nrunning, stop by, princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.17,0:16:50.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, of course I will, Toto.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.37,0:16:57.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuba is going to do a great deal\Nfor this dry desert country of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.51,0:17:01.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.33,0:17:15.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toto that's this guy whatever it's worth
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.19,0:17:19.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,vivi dear i have faith in you and the king
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.85,0:17:27.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a good man, a true king who would\Nnever betray his country, I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.33,0:18:00.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This rebellion is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.49,0:18:03.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A bunch of faithless fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.23,0:18:06.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See ya, Vivi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.63,0:18:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you grow up to\Nbecome a great princess.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:21.60,0:18:26.27,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(707.98,610)\fad(938,0)\blur1\bord3.8\fscx88\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\c&H000000&\3c&H2F2E31&\1a&HFF&\3a&H10&\t(893,938,\1a&H00&)}Kingdom of Arabasta\N11 Years Ago
Dialogue: 2,0:18:21.60,0:18:26.27,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(707.98,610)\fad(938,0)\blur0.6\bord0.6\fscx88\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\c&HFAF9F6&\3c&HFAF9F6&\1a&HFF&\4a&HFF&\t(893,938,\1a&H00&)}Kingdom of Arabasta\N11 Years Ago
Dialogue: 3,0:18:21.60,0:18:26.27,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(707.98,610)\fad(938,0)\blur0.6\bord0\fscx88\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\c&HF5F5F5&\4a&HFF&}Kingdom of Arabasta\N11 Years Ago
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.93,0:18:46.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.07,0:18:48.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our village has dried up.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:47.17,0:18:50.46,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(707.98,610)\fad(477,0)\blur0.5\bord4.9\fscx88\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(432,477,\1a&H00&)}Koza\NA Boy from Town
Dialogue: 2,0:18:47.17,0:18:50.46,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(707.98,610)\fad(477,0)\blur0.5\bord0.6\fscx88\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\c&HFEFEFF&\3c&HFEFEFF&\1a&HFF&\4a&HFF&\t(432,477,\1a&H00&)}Koza\NA Boy from Town
Dialogue: 3,0:18:47.17,0:18:50.46,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(707.98,610)\fad(477,0)\blur0.5\bord0\fscx88\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\c&HFEFEFF&\4a&HFF&}Koza\NA Boy from Town
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.91,0:18:51.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you sit there and do nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.15,0:18:53.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weather is beyond my control as king.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.19,0:18:56.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot command nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.43,0:18:57.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's beyond any man's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.01,0:18:59.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is nothing I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.73,0:19:02.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My dad always told me the\Nking's power is limitless.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.03,0:19:04.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can do anything he wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.59,0:19:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My abilities exist only\Nin the realm of men.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.33,0:19:08.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not some kind of god.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.49,0:19:11.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your Highness, this boy's\Nfather has come to the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.49,0:19:13.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My deepest apologies, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.49,0:19:14.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my fault.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:14.40,0:19:18.37,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(707.98,610)\fad(482,0)\blur0.5\bord4.9\fscx88\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(437,482,\1a&H00&)}Toto, the Boy's Father\N{\fscx90\fscy90}(The Man from Yuba)
Dialogue: 2,0:19:14.40,0:19:18.37,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(707.98,610)\fad(482,0)\blur0.5\bord0.6\fscx88\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\c&HFEFEFF&\3c&HFEFEFF&\1a&HFF&\4a&HFF&\t(437,482,\1a&H00&)}Toto, the Boy's Father\N{\fscx90\fscy90}(The Man from Yuba)
Dialogue: 3,0:19:14.40,0:19:18.37,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(707.98,610)\fad(482,0)\blur0.5\bord0\fscx88\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\c&HFEFEFF&\4a&HFF&}Toto, the Boy's Father\N{\fscx90\fscy90}(The Man from Yuba)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.51,0:19:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Forgive my stupid son, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.39,0:19:18.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Place the punishment\Nfor his actions on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.05,0:19:20.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll accept any penalties.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.37,0:19:21.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my fault, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.81,0:19:22.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I beg of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.01,0:19:25.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.51,0:19:26.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.65,0:19:27.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.35,0:19:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Insolent.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.63,0:19:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thoughtless.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.71,0:19:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.59,0:19:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your name is Toto, is it not?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.55,0:19:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.46,0:19:38.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will officially grant temporary\Nsanctuary to any villagers
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.99,0:19:41.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who are suffering due to the\Ncrisis caused by this drought.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.55,0:19:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're welcome to live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.23,0:19:46.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alubarna is a fine place for\Nyou to plan for your future.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.03,0:19:50.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, we appreciate your\Nbenevolence. Thank you, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.03,0:19:52.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, sir
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.69,0:19:56.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever I don't want to\Nlive in this stupid capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.21,0:19:57.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that the best you could do for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.97,0:20:00.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait Koza get back here
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.39,0:20:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.30,0:20:09.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toto. Your son's comments represent\Nthe people's frustrations.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.11,0:20:10.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.85,0:20:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He cares for those who suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.69,0:20:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is why he is acting in such a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.43,0:20:22.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey there, crybaby?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.87,0:20:27.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say to me, midget?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.37,0:20:29.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,King Cobra
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.13,0:20:31.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Igaram, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.69,0:20:35.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With all due respect, it's unrealistic\Nto think we can support them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.45,0:20:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not without exhausting\Nour funds, sire. Fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.89,0:20:41.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will bear the burden of\Nthis crisis with our people.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.51,0:20:43.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their pleas will not be ignored.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.25,0:20:44.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.53,0:20:45.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.67,0:20:47.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.43,0:20:50.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, it's Princess Vivi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.57,0:20:55.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I fought with that boy and got beaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.69,0:20:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.60,0:20:57.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Princess Vivi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.77,0:21:01.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare a commoner lay even a finger\Nout of the mirror of this esteemed house!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.27,0:21:02.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That boy's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.31,0:21:04.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait, Igaram, you must calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.43,0:21:07.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, my deepest apologies!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.67,0:21:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, sire, kill me instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.55,0:21:11.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're both idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.19,0:21:18.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You fools!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.61,0:21:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a children's quarrel!
