Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.51,0:21:31.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brute on sale!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.33,0:21:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.24,0:21:34.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.16,0:21:34.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Punch for the face!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.07,0:21:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, she's a princess, Koza!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.01,0:21:38.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's got snotty princess Alesson!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.13,0:21:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take her down!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.25,0:21:40.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Vivi!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.69,0:21:42.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up, traitors!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.75,0:21:45.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you know we're\Nsupposed to cheer for Koza?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.53,0:21:50.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I become your leader when I beat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.61,0:21:51.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.01,0:21:54.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd never lose a fight to you, midget.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.93,0:21:58.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never lost a fight,\Nespecially to a dumb girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.27,0:22:01.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.37,0:22:06.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can do it, Koza, fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.05,0:22:08.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, get her!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.17,0:22:19.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, you guys, listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.61,0:22:23.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As of today, Princess Vivi will\Nbe vice leader of the Sansan clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.55,0:22:25.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does anyone have a problem with that? No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.89,0:22:30.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, Igaram.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.53,0:22:33.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi has made some new friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.19,0:22:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.41,0:22:39.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is the most important thing to have\Nif she's to rule Alabasta in my stead.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.77,0:22:41.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The people must follow her.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.23,0:22:54.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toto, ma'am, good morning. Where's Leader?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.13,0:22:56.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.09,0:22:58.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're looking for\NKoza, he already left.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.85,0:23:00.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I assume he's at the usual spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.83,0:23:01.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.09,0:23:06.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Vivi, you coming for lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.25,0:23:08.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, please, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.11,0:23:11.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a strange country we live in!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.33,0:23:14.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The princess mingling\Nwith commoners like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.63,0:23:15.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who would have ever thought?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.89,0:23:17.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A sign of peaceful times.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.83,0:23:20.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And will you be joining us?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.09,0:23:22.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, no, that's quite all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.61,0:23:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I packed a lunch today.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.25,0:23:25.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.51,0:23:32.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.87,0:23:37.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.73,0:23:39.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cobra, my lord
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.03,0:23:43.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I asked you not to follow me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.81,0:23:47.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's just I wanted to make\Nsure my precious daughter's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.73,0:23:51.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go home, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.23,0:23:54.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't babysit you and\NPrincess Vivi, too. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.83,0:23:56.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go home, you heard me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.53,0:24:16.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello princess, you lost little\Ngirl, we'll help you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.81,0:24:21.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Protector, sunset clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.89,0:24:25.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is wrong with these kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.17,0:24:26.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They won't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.57,0:24:30.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Baby, get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.79,0:24:32.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're trying to hold these\Nguys off when you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.99,0:24:34.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Baby, get out of here right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.93,0:24:37.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you gotta run now! I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.11,0:24:41.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not here to kill you,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.07,0:24:45.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we just want to kidnap you\Nfor a ransom from your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.15,0:24:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But these other kids...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.09,0:24:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.95,0:24:53.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, now just come with\Nus quietly, Princess Vivi.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.95,0:24:58.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Step back!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.47,0:25:01.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Protect her to the death, Sand Sand Clan!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.09,0:25:07.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You

